// The system at a glance (README). Render as: cloud-architecture-diagram
direction right
typeface clean

People [color: gray, label: "People"] {
  Team [icon: users, label: "Team: dashboard and chat"]
  Client [icon: terminal, label: "MCP clients: Claude Code, Cursor"]
  Shopper [icon: shopping-cart, label: "Shoppers"]
}

Cluster [icon: k8s-kubernetes, color: blue, label: "Kubernetes (same Helm charts locally and on a VPS)"] {
  Gateway [icon: shield, color: purple, label: "Gateway: one MCP endpoint, keys, roles, audit log"]
  WooMcp [icon: node, color: green, label: "woo-mcp: products and orders as tools"]
  Store [icon: woocommerce, color: green, label: "WooCommerce store"]
}

Others [icon: server, color: orange, label: "Other MCP servers"]
LLM [icon: gemini, color: gray, label: "LLM for the chat agent"]

Team > Gateway: log in
Client > Gateway: one URL + personal API key
Shopper > Store: shop and check out
Gateway > WooMcp: gateway's own credential
WooMcp > Store: REST API
Gateway > Others: gateway's own credentials
Gateway > LLM: tool calling
